---
config:
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 20
    width: 100
    diagramMarginX: 20
    wrap: true
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller
    participant Front as Native front
    participant Worker as Policy worker
    participant Runner as Job runner
    participant Job as Managed job
    participant Publisher as Publisher
    participant File as Result file
    Note over Front,Runner: Rust code in one process<br/>ravel and keyed-launch
    Caller->>Front: Request and unchanged prompt (O1, O3)
    Front->>Front: Admit settings, inputs and policy entry
    Front->>Worker: Private spawn, admitted hello<br/>then request (O2)
    Worker->>Worker: Import policy, report policy data
    Worker-->>Front: Policy frame
    Front->>Worker: Context/selection requests after judgment
    Worker->>Worker: Optional loadContext, then select
    Worker-->>Front: Context and selected-command data (O3)
    Front->>Front: Judge, close socket<br/>wait, resolve executable
    Note over Front,Job: R4 — managed spawn follows worker wait
    Front->>Front: Reserve result output (O9)
    Front->>File: Allocate private channel (O4, O5)
    Front->>Front: Assemble channel, argv and signals
    Front->>Runner: Run the paired launch (R5)
    Runner->>Job: Spawn group<br/>job/terminal contract (O8)
    Job->>Front: Ordinary output goes to stderr (O9)
    Job->>Publisher: end-session RESULT
    Publisher->>File: Complete temporary file<br/>no-clobber link (O5)
    Publisher-->>Job: Publication succeeded
    Job-->>Runner: Fixture exits 7
    Runner->>Runner: Group cleanup before reap<br/>restore terminal<br/>confirm group (O6, O8)
    Runner->>File: Record final appearance<br/>not contents
    Runner-->>Front: Reaped ending, signalled, Group::Gone
    Front->>File: Anchored exact read<br/>explicit close
    Front->>Front: Restore output<br/>settle cleanup/signals (O7, O9)
    Front-->>Caller: Exact opaque bytes, success (O6, O9)
    Note over Runner,Job: Fixture does not force escalation<br/>running appearance polls are omitted
